{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00197","headline":"七月十五日题章敬寺 · 德宗皇帝","name":"七月十五日题章敬寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"招提迩皇邑，复道连重城。\n法筵会早秋，驾言访禅扃。\n尝闻大仙教，清净宗无生。\n七物匪吾宝，万行先求成。\n名相既双寂，繁华奚所荣。\n金风扇微凉，远烟凝翠晶。\n松院静苔色，竹房深磬声。\n境幽真虑恬，道胜外物轻。\n意适本非说，含毫空复情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}